2026-01-22 02:15:34.380|INFO||org.kie.kogito.testcontainers.KogitoGenericContainer|STDERR: INFO  2026-01-22 10:15:34,275 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:852 - redpanda.storage_compaction_key_map_memory_limit_percent:12	- Limit on `storage_compaction_key_map_memory`, expressed as a percentage of memory per shard, that bounds the amount of memory used by compaction key-offset maps. Memory per shard is computed after `data_transforms_per_core_memory_reservation`, and only applies when `log_compaction_use_sliding_window` is set to `true`.
